{"id":"KvK0ahaHoTxgT5b","name":"skills_mage_talking","type":"sequence","entries":[{"id":"dQI9J61HFc2VyZu","name":"open_menu_command","criteria":[{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":1},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":2},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":3},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":4},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":6}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"command":"core-menu panelskillsaltern %player_name%","type":"console_run_command","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"qWKTho9z57QAG3R","name":"first_spoken","criteria":[{"fact":"HPujGHKmvMMBe6u","operator":"==","value":0},{"fact":"Y0d2bAueO4M2c5G","operator":"==","value":0},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":1},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":2},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":3},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":4},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":6}],"modifiers":[{"fact":"OltLRPi51Bq5aGd","operator":"=","value":1}],"triggers":["IR8I8ykfuv1MuVF","l3HHh9nExc3dmRt"],"speaker":"Lg09KrqQIVzJden","text":"ᚠᚢᚦᚨᚱᚲᚷᚹᚺᚾᛁᛃᛇᛈᛉᛊᛏᛒᛖᛗᛚᛜᛞᛟᚠᚢᚦᚨᚱ\nᚲᚷᚹᚺᚾᛁᛃᛇᛈᛉᛇᛈᛉᛊᛏᛒᛖᛗᛚᛜᛞᚺᚾᛁᛃᛇᛈᛉ\nᛖᛗᛚᛜᛞᛟᚠ ... ᚢᚦᚨᚱᚠᚢᚦᚨᚱᚲᚷᚹᚺᚾᛁᛃ","duration":1000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"IR8I8ykfuv1MuVF","name":"spoken_2","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["DyNeOvU9tZsLiX1","l3HHh9nExc3dmRt"],"speaker":"Lg09KrqQIVzJden","text":"Oh, perdona: suelo hablar en lengua arcana y los mortales no la entienden.\nAsí que tú eres quien devolvió la memoria al Rey... El Alquimista también te ha visto, ¿sabes?\n<#C9A8FF>Si quieres sobrevivir a lo que viene, necesitarás algo más que suerte. Yo puedo enseñarte.","duration":1000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"CL4lwN6BzXfFyi3","name":"altern_spoken","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["0XIzO8SbeBsVK9y"],"speaker":"IiY432VLyYHg26J","text":"He oído de tus “hazañas”...  \n¿La maldición? La enfrentaste tú solo...  \nY ahora quedaste así...  \n— La verdad, no te ves nada mal...","duration":1000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"0XIzO8SbeBsVK9y","name":"npc_spoken","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["1OvYp1ekdRdCBmt"],"speaker":"Lg09KrqQIVzJden","text":"¿Halagos?  \nNo me comprarás con eso...  \n\nBueno, tal vez un poco.  \n— ¿Y bien? ¿Qué quieres?","duration":1000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"1OvYp1ekdRdCBmt","name":"options_altern","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":[],"speaker":"Lg09KrqQIVzJden","text":"Antiguo hechicero de magia extranjera","options":[{"text":"Seamos socios, cuando este a punto de morir, curame","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["jFIWnDCmbJf2aoV"]},{"text":"Ver mis habilidades <#7FD8FF>Abrir AuraSkills","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["9LPWb2e2JxmRwCR","Z8DhOJGpoDGqckd"]},{"text":"Puedo traerte las cosas que me pidas a cambio de tu magia","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["pYjykJag9Kpqrph"]},{"text":"Enseñame lo que puedes hacer","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["EQNmJCrhVPOBMK0"]}],"duration":1000,"type":"option","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"jFIWnDCmbJf2aoV","name":"npc_spoken_2","criteria":[],"modifiers":[{"fact":"Y0d2bAueO4M2c5G","operator":"=","value":1},{"fact":"q6iwhRhFNnG5wWp","operator":"=","value":1}],"triggers":["IcoQVpmLY9I5Wtk","NlKEPKxBOHo8xSL"],"speaker":"Lg09KrqQIVzJden","text":"¿Que te crees que soy...?  \n¿Un dios, tal vez?  \nNo puedo hacer eso.  \n\nPero...\nsi me traes <#C68FFA>x16 Amatistas<#FFFFFF>  \n—Puedo fortalecer tus habilidades. Un poco.","duration":1000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"T3ixLhCYG2ZOssA","name":"trait_altern","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["l3HHh9nExc3dmRt","OyhoFU70xPkpaRL"],"title":"<green>ᴛʀᴀᴛᴏ ʜᴇᴄʜᴏ 🗡","subtitle":"<gray>ᴛʀᴀᴇᴍᴇ <yellow>10</yellow> <gray>ᴍᴀɴᴢᴀɴᴀꜱ ᴅᴇ ᴏʀᴏ","durations":{"enabled":false,"value":{}},"type":"show_title","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"QkUb9PdMP1rwxji","name":"second_mainthread","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["4LpC7yuLJV1sUL0","l3HHh9nExc3dmRt"],"speaker":"Lg09KrqQIVzJden","text":"¿Otra vez tú? Bien. El Alquimista no descansa, y tú tampoco deberías.\n\n¿Qué necesitas ahora?","duration":1000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"Tfw2QkiWOXmXtbH","name":"send_message_is_mision_complete","criteria":[],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["7IO8xIltUBMFN1r"],"speaker":"EvcKz9cUa5UKBEm","message":"Parece que ya tienes lo que acordamos, traeme las <yellow>10 Manzanas Doradas</yellow> <white>y te dare las pociones que necesitas...</white>","type":"send_message","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"xut1u8gXKcqijdu","name":"increase_apples_on_inventory","criteria":[{"fact":"HPujGHKmvMMBe6u","operator":"==","value":1},{"fact":"Fru1WTzViwB0aG6","operator":">=","value":10}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["Tfw2QkiWOXmXtbH"],"type":"simple_action","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"Q8fPjTatMmWzDJf","name":"player_picking_apples","triggers":["xut1u8gXKcqijdu"],"item":{"case":"serialized_item","value":{"material":"GOLDEN_APPLE","name":"GOLDEN_APPLE","amount":10,"bytes":"H4sIAAAAAAAA/+NiYGBm4HZJLEkMSy0qzszPY2AQiOVgYMpMYRDLzcxLTS5KTCuxSs/PSUnNi08sKMhJZWZgTc4vzSthYGDgYgAAFspyYD8AAAA="}},"type":"on_item_pickup","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"e6LP6tAEq35saMu","name":"main_thread","criteria":[{"fact":"OltLRPi51Bq5aGd","operator":"==","value":1},{"fact":"Y0d2bAueO4M2c5G","operator":"==","value":0},{"fact":"HPujGHKmvMMBe6u","operator":"==","value":0},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":1},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":2},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":3},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":4},{"fact":"epJL7EGWiFbCY2p","operator":"!=","value":6}],"modifiers":[],"triggers":["QkUb9PdMP1rwxji","l3HHh9nExc3dmRt"],"speaker":"Lg09KrqQIVzJden","text":"ᚠᚢᚦᚨᚱᚲᚷᚹᚺᚾᛁᛃᛇᛈᛉᛊᛏᛒᛖᛗᛚᛜᛞᛟᚠᚢᚦᚨᚱ\nᚲᚷᚹᚺᚾᛁᛃᛇᛈᛉᛇᛈᛉᛊᛏᛒᛖᛗᛚᛜᛞᚺᚾᛁᛃᛇᛈᛉ\nᛖᛗᛚᛜᛞᛟᚠ ... ᚢᚦᚨᚱᚠᚢᚦᚨᚱᚲᚷᚹᚺᚾᛁᛃ","duration":1000,"type":"spoken","_genericBlueprint":null},{"id":"M3e5qySit0NNpfX"